        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>中国7~24月龄婴幼儿平衡膳食宝塔</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']]}\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 1000px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 14px 20px 10px 20px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Top header ---------- */\n  .header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n  }\n  .logo-left {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    width: 200px;\n  }\n  .logo-left .placeholder { margin: 0; }\n  .logo-left .logo-text {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    color: #4a7a3a;\n  }\n  .logo-left .logo-text .en {\n    font-size: 9px;\n    color: #6b8f5c;\n  }\n  .header-center {\n    flex: 1;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding-top: 4px;\n  }\n  .header-center h1 {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #d94f1e;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .header-center .subtitle {\n    margin-top: 12px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .logo-right {\n    width: 200px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 6px;\n  }\n  .logo-right .logo-text {\n    font-size: 9px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    color: #1a4f9c;\n  }\n  .logo-right .logo-text .en { color: #1a4f9c; }\n\n  /* ---------- Main 3-zone body ---------- */\n  .main {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n  }\n  .col-left { width: 250px; padding-top: 4px; }\n  .col-center { width: 330px; }\n  .col-right { width: 360px; padding-top: 6px; }\n\n  /* ---------- Left bullet list ---------- */\n  ul.tips {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  ul.tips li {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n    padding-left: 20px;\n    position: relative;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n  ul.tips li::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 2px;\n    width: 13px;\n    height: 13px;\n    background: #7fbf3f;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Center pagoda ---------- */\n  .pagoda .placeholder {\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  .pagoda-caption {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    margin-top: 14px;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Right data table ---------- */\n  .age-head {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    gap: 34px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #d94f1e;\n    padding-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  table.data {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-size: 12px;\n  }\n  table.data td {\n    padding: 5px 4px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n  table.data td.label {\n    width: 90px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n  table.data td.c1, table.data td.c2 {\n    text-align: center;\n    width: 135px;\n  }\n  .rule {\n    border: 0;\n    border-top: 1px solid #b9b9b9;\n    margin: 6px 0;\n  }\n  .note {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n  .note .strong { font-weight: bold; }\n  .note-small {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Baby illustration ---------- */\n  .baby {\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Footer ---------- */\n  .footer {\n    margin-top: 8px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #666;\n  }\n  .footer .version { width: 120px; }\n  .footer .center {\n    flex: 1;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #d94f1e;\n  }\n  .footer .right { width: 120px; }\n\n  /* ---------- Placeholders ---------- */\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #aaa;\n    background: #f7f7f7;\n    color: #888;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 2px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <!-- ================= HEADER ================= -->\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"logo-left\">\n      <figure class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:46px;height:46px;\">[Logo: 中国营养学会会徽]</figure>\n      <div class=\"logo-text\">\n        中国营养学会<br>\n        <span class=\"en\">Chinese Nutrition Society</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"header-center\">\n      <h1>中国7~24月龄婴幼儿平衡膳食宝塔</h1>\n      <div class=\"subtitle\">依据《中国居民膳食指南（2022）》绘制</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"logo-right\">\n      <figure class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:40px;height:40px;\">[Logo: MCNC-CNS 图标]</figure>\n      <div class=\"logo-text\">\n        <span class=\"en\">MCNC-CNS</span><br>\n        中国营养学会<br>\n        妇幼营养分会\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ================= MAIN ================= -->\n  <div class=\"main\">\n\n    <!-- ---------- LEFT COLUMN ---------- -->\n    <div class=\"col-left\">\n      <ul class=\"tips\">\n        <li>继续母乳喂养</li>\n        <li>满6月龄开始添加辅食</li>\n        <li>从肉/肝泥、蛋黄泥、铁强化谷粉等糊状食物开始</li>\n        <li>母乳或配方奶不足时补充</li>\n        <li>仍需要补充维生素D，400IU/d</li>\n        <li>回应式喂养，鼓励逐步自主进食</li>\n        <li>逐步过渡到多样化膳食</li>\n        <li>辅食不加或少加盐、糖和调味品</li>\n        <li>定期测量体重和身长</li>\n        <li>饮食卫生、进食安全</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <div class=\"baby\">\n        <figure class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:230px;height:200px;\">[Illustration: 婴幼儿坐在餐椅上自主进食，左下方]</figure>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- ---------- CENTER COLUMN ---------- -->\n    <div class=\"col-center pagoda\">\n      <figure class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:320px;height:290px;\">[Diagram: 膳食宝塔图（塔形分层食物图片：谷类/奶类、蔬菜水果、肉蛋鱼、油盐），居中]</figure>\n      <div class=\"pagoda-caption\">\n        中国营养学会指导<br>\n        中国营养学会妇幼营养分会编制\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- ---------- RIGHT COLUMN ---------- -->\n    <div class=\"col-right\">\n      <div class=\"age-head\">\n        <span>7~12月龄</span>\n        <span>13~24月龄</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <table class=\"data\">\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"label\">盐</td>\n          <td class=\"c1\">不建议额外添加</td>\n          <td class=\"c2\">0~1.5克</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"label\">油</td>\n          <td class=\"c1\">0~10克</td>\n          <td class=\"c2\">5~15克</td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n\n      <hr class=\"rule\">\n\n      <table class=\"data\">\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"label\">蛋类</td>\n          <td class=\"c1\">15~50克</td>\n          <td class=\"c2\">25~50克</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"label\">畜禽肉鱼类</td>\n          <td class=\"c1\">25~75克</td>\n          <td class=\"c2\">50~75克</td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n\n      <hr class=\"rule\">\n\n      <table class=\"data\">\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"label\">蔬菜类</td>\n          <td class=\"c1\">25~100克</td>\n          <td class=\"c2\">50~150克</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"label\">水果类</td>\n          <td class=\"c1\">25~100克</td>\n          <td class=\"c2\">50~150克</td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n\n      <hr class=\"rule\">\n\n      <div class=\"note\">\n        继续母乳喂养，逐步过渡到谷类为主食<br>\n        母乳700~500毫升 母乳600~400毫升\n      </div>\n\n      <table class=\"data\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\">\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"label\">谷类</td>\n          <td class=\"c1\">20~75克</td>\n          <td class=\"c2\">50~100克</td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n\n      <hr class=\"rule\">\n\n      <div class=\"note-small\">\n        满6月龄添加辅食时，须咨询专业人员做出决定\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ================= FOOTER ================= -->\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"version\">V2022-2.00</div>\n    <div class=\"center\">妇幼营养分会网址 www.mcnutri.cn 图像文件下载</div>\n    <div class=\"right\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
